`src/bench.zig` and `src/display.zig` are a translation of C source from libzstd's command-line
program (github.com/facebook/zstd, tag v1.5.7, commit
f8745da6ff1ad1e7bab384bd1f9d742439278e99) into Zig. The BSD licence that source
