WHAT WAS TAKEN

Translated (restructured into Zig, decision-for-decision the same, the
messages verbatim):

  programs/zstdcli.c     options, defaults, program-name behaviours,
                         stdin/stdout decisions, usage text          -> src/main.zig
  programs/fileio.c      FIO_* compression, decompression, test and
                         list of files; destination names; overwrite,
                         --rm and permission handling; messages      -> src/fileio.zig, src/list.zig
  programs/util.c        UTIL_makeHumanReadableSize,
                         UTIL_requireUserConfirmation                -> src/display.zig, src/fileio.zig
  programs/benchzstd.c,  the -b benchmark: blocks, timed runs,
  programs/benchfn.c     output                                      -> src/bench.zig

Not taken: programs/dibio.c, fileio_asyncio.c, lorem.c, datagen.c,
timefn.c, and the gzip/xz/lz4 paths of fileio.c.

